data: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":9,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"success\":true,\"work_packages\":[{\"id\":37,\"subject\":\"Clean the on-hold list for the League response\",\"description\":\"Triage the on-hold projects for the League response. Reconcile the non-payment holds against the remittance records, and review the information-request holds against their notice dates and response periods. State the correct status for each and the action it requires. Feeds the 08/15/2025 League response and the 09/10/2025 APUC briefing.\",\"status\":\"In progress\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"Meera Vellanki\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":15,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:07.847Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:08.070Z\"},{\"id\":38,\"subject\":\"Resolve the Elmsworth filing status\",\"description\":\"Two applications are on file for the City of Elmsworth municipal service center, PXA-2023-0412 and PXA-2025-0198. Determine the correct disposition of each and the queue position that results. Coordinate with Bill Tran (City of Elmsworth) for any confirmation the disposition requires.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"Meera Vellanki\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:08.851Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:08.933Z\"},{\"id\":39,\"subject\":\"Rule on the Harkwell Ridge ISA amendment request\",\"description\":\"Hailbouy Solar (Corey Lindqvist) has requested a capacity increase on the executed Harkwell Ridge ISA. Determine whether the request can be handled as an amendment and what path the developer must follow. Coordinate with the DER Planning Group on any study or queue consequences.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"Ivo Grantham\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-08\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:09.591Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:09.910Z\"},{\"id\":40,\"subject\":\"Unstick the applications parked at screening\",\"description\":\"Twelve applications are parked at screening over conflicting POI protection requirements between two governing standards. Determine whether the hold is permitted, how each application should be routed, and what reconciliation the standards themselves need.\",\"status\":\"In progress\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"Evan Solberg\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":10,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:10.620Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:10.716Z\"},{\"id\":41,\"subject\":\"Allocate scarce RTUs and reclosers to completed sites\",\"description\":\"Seven construction-complete sites are awaiting utility-owned RTU and POI recloser equipment against a long supplier lead time: two sets arrive 08/2025, the next delivery is 03/2026. Rank the sites for allocation and state the basis for the ranking. Engage the vendor on lead time and market alternatives. SCADA/EMS holds one of the two 08/2025 sets as system spare under the standing reserve, so one set is uncommitted for this allocation.\",\"status\":\"In progress\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"High\",\"assignee\":\"Marcus Deele\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":20,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:11.091Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:11.168Z\"},{\"id\":42,\"subject\":\"Classify the Merrow Creamery PV addition\",\"description\":\"Application PXA-2025-0244 proposes a rooftop PV system at Merrow Creamery, filed as standalone. Determine the correct program classification and scope for the application, and what conditions attach to it. Contact the developer for any information the determination requires.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"Meera Vellanki\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:11.504Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:11.570Z\"},{\"id\":43,\"subject\":\"Review application PXA-2025-0231\",\"description\":\"Application PXA-2025-0231 was placed on abnormality hold at intake screening. Work the application against the governing standard, determine the correct disposition, and state what the applicant must submit, if anything. Clear or continue the hold accordingly.\",\"status\":\"In progress\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"Tomás Ibarra\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":10,\"start_date\":\"2025-06-27\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:11.940Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:12.005Z\"},{\"id\":44,\"subject\":\"Respond to the Feeder ALN-108 pre-application request\",\"description\":\"A pre-application request dated 07/02/2025 asks for available capacity on Feeder ALN-108 and cites the published hosting capacity map. Determine the figure the response should carry and what the requester should be advised. Flag any map maintenance the request implies.\",\"status\":\"New\",\"type\":\"Task\",\"priority\":\"Normal\",\"assignee\":\"June Halloway\",\"author\":\"OpenProject Admin\",\"project_id\":3,\"done_ratio\":0,\"start_date\":\"2025-07-02\",\"due_date\":\"2025-08-15\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:12.330Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-21T03:27:12.392Z\"},{\"id\":45,\"subject\":\"Process the municipal witness-test waiver batch\",\"description\":\"Six municipal arrays have submitted commissioning checklists pre-marked as waiver eligible. Determine each array's actual waiver eligibility and schedule whatever the outcome